# ✓ CommonJS and browser expose the same public contract
# ✓ new game starts with bounded resources and deterministic fresh state
# ✓ phase gates and invalid inputs cannot change resources or time
# ✓ preparation is finite and each non-brewing activity is once per day
# ✓ brewing pays once, requires three valid hits, and retains batch quality
# ✓ salvaged hops improve the next completed batch and cancellation forfeits its cost
